## Weekly reference profile (use for day-matching)

Weekdays run roughly 200-220 daytime transactions. Saturday runs 256-270. Sunday sits between.
A change that only shows up in a raw seven-day mean, and disappears under day-of-week matching,
is a calendar artifact and must be reported as such.

